                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "IS Defense\npros:\n//fast game with modern day graphics with easy controls that moves from location A to B to C and so on\n//good amount of action and special effects\ncons:\n//a lot of difficult battles\n//some enemies have too much armor plating\n//some suicide vehicles are too fast\n//some suicide vehicles still explode and damage you even after shooting them\n//too many enemies constantly spawn\n//upgrades are a grindfest and require a lot of resources\n//unlocking new maps have special requirements\n//repetitive\n\n//good game\nPersonal Suggested Purchase Price: $0.99 Or Less During Sale\nextra notes:\n//you are an artillery machine gun defender fighting off waves of enemies forces\n//spend your resources on supply drops, troops, artillery, and reinforcements\n//after you get to the final map and constantly lose to cheap suiciders your game is over",
